re face time and they're they're in  lucas still  like you know without those guys helping  me i really have a shock to climb this  mountain right  so i just feel blessed yeah i'm glad  you're okay  so mike are you starting training  tomorrow to swim across the english  english channel i mean what's next for  you  it's really interesting when i finished  my walk i talked to you guys  i felt like what's next i want to climb  my eyes let's do this  and i don't feel like that right now i  feel like  give me a dog and a girlfriend you just  stay at home for a while  a dog and a girlfriend don't you mean a  girlfriend and a dog  [Laughter]  and a dog whatever comes first mike it  doesn't matter  backwards in the mountains  well take a rest thanks so much for  joining us this morning congrats again  what an achievement that is mike posner  john cadrowski  and uh sorry before i go um yeah you  know  big i want to do this interview today  was uh i climbed to raise money for the  detroit justice  center that does justice reform work in  detroit my hometown  that's right and uh we could use your  help all your viewers  um if you if you could please donate  whether it whether it's one dollar five  dollars just go to  either mikeposner.com or gofundme.com  everest yeah we mentioned that you  raised two hundred and thirty thousand  dollars  and gayle you get the dog first because  the dog helps you get the girl feel free  yes often that's the case  [Laughter]  all right thank you both

